    "title": "Dapi leads Cherry Hill East to victory against Absegami - Boys lacrosse recap - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Advance Local Express Desk ,\n1 days ago Gian Dapi scored five goals to lead Cherry Hill East to a 15-4 victory over Absegami on Tuesday in Cherry Hill. Thomas Ladik added four goals and two assists for Cherry Hill East (1-3). Nolan Cruz contributed four goals and one assist, while Brendan Curran had one goal and two assists. EJ Mahoney scored one goal and added one assist. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
